[00:00.00][by:非洲-love]
[00:16.14]We're a thousand miles from comfort
[00:16.14]安逸与我们相隔万里
[00:20.03]We have travelled land and sea
[00:20.03]我们赤足跋涉千山万水
[00:24.02]But as long as you are with me
[00:24.02]只要有你相伴
[00:28.19]There's no place I'd rather be
[00:28.19]我就无处想去
[00:32.53]I would wait forever
[00:32.53]愿永远守候着你
[00:36.06]Exulted in the scene
[00:36.06]为你每一次露面欣喜
[00:40.10]As long as I am with you
[00:40.10]只要有你相伴
[00:44.18]My heart continues to beat
[00:44.18]我的心就小鹿乱撞
[00:48.47]With every step we take, Kyoto to The Bay
[00:48.47]一步步小心翼翼  京都海湾处歇脚
[00:52.37]Strolling so casually
[00:52.37]步伐随意散漫
[00:56.60]We're different and the same, gave you another name
[00:56.60]我们不同又相似  取了各自的名字
[01:00.19]Switch up the batteries
